{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover 125 unique flowers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/newflowers.png?t=1751444359\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Flower Traits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/trait_icons__2_.png?t=1751444359\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flower have traits that affect the world in different ways. Each flower has a different combination of traits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Plant &amp; Pick</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/harvesting.gif?t=1751444359\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Random Mutation &amp; Cross Pollination</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/cross_pollenation_popup.png?t=1751444359\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every flower has a chance to mutate into something new. Strategically plant flowers near each other to encourage cross pollination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/walking_framed.gif?t=1751444359\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">3 Scenarios</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/senario_splitpsd__1_.png?t=1751444359\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Complete Objectives</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta